# Local secrets for `npx wrangler pages dev`.
# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in one mode.
# .dev.vars is gitignored. Do not commit real values.
# Leave everything blank to preview with sample events.

# Mode A. Secret iCal address from Google Calendar settings.
# ICS_URL=""

# Mode B. Google Calendar API, read-only. Used only when ICS_URL is empty.
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=""
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=""
# GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN=""
# CALENDAR_ID="primary"
